@startuml

title The tick ingest pipeline

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Producers\nfeeds and vendors" as prod
queue "NATS core\nsynthetic.v1.ops.tick.<source>" as nats
rectangle "Receive\ndecode, age gate,\nroute by datum key" as recv

package "Lane 1 to N, one writer thread each" {
    queue "Ring buffer\nbounded, newest wins" as ring
    rectangle "Conflate\nlatest tick per datum" as conf
    rectangle "Batch\nevery tick taken this cycle" as batch
}

rectangle "Live fan-out\ncore NATS, no ack" as live
database "Observation store\none transaction per batch" as db
rectangle "Live consumers\ncharts, CRM bridge" as cons
rectangle "Readers of the store\nreports, history" as readers

prod --> nats
nats --> recv
recv --> ring : one slot, never waits
ring --> conf
ring --> batch
conf --> live : newest value first
live --> cons
batch --> db : multi-row insert
db --> readers

note bottom of batch
    A datum key maps to one lane.
    One writer owns each lane.
    A tick keeps its order within its series.
end note

@enduml
